    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nSherry FitzGerald Reilly are pleased to bring to the market, this beautifully presented three bedroom semi - detached house which is ideal for those starting out or those about to sit back and enjoy life. Presented as you would wish for immediate occupation this attractive home offers a bright, light filled and cleverly designed layout. It also boasts an array of modern features / extras, fresh neutral decor and a delightful low maintenance render. \n\nNewbury Park is an established, well maintained modern development ideally positioned adjacent to Derrinturn village and a host of quality local services including shops, schools, health centre, church and a variety of sporting and recreational facilities.\nCommuting to Dublin City and its surrounding areas couldn't be easier via a frequent daily bus service and convenience to the M4 Motorway.\nViewing of this wonderful home is highly recommended."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "\nEntrance Hall - 5.6m x 2.0m\nWith tiled floor, coved ceiling, under stairs storage, alarm keypad, telephone point.\n\nLounge - 5.0m x 3.5m\nWith feature fireplace, laminate flooring, bay window, tv point, coved ceiling, double doors to kitchen.\n\nKitchen Dining Room - 2.5m x 2.0m\n\n\nKitchen - 5.3m x 3.5m\n\"L Shaped\" with fitted Shaker style kitchen, electric oven, hob, extractor, fridge/freezer, dishwasher, washing machine, tiled floor, tiled splashback, French door to rear.\n\nW.C. - 1.6m x 1.4m\nWith wc, whb, tiled floor, tiled walls.\n\nBedroom 1 - 3.8m x 3.2m\nTo back with tongue & groove flooring, fitted wardrobes.\n\nEn-Suite - 2.5m x 1.0m\nWith Triton T80sr shower, wc, whb, tiled floor, tiled splashback, folding shower screen, shaving light, mirror, extractor.\n\nBedroom 2 - 4.4m x 2.5m\nTo front with fitted wardrobes, laminate flooring, bay window.\n\nBedroom 3 - 2.6m x 2.5m\nTo front with fitted wardrobes, laminate flooring.\n\nBathroom - 2.7m x 2.0m\nWith bath, wc, whb, tiled floor, tiled splashback, shaving light, mirror front bathroom cabinet, extractor.\n\nLanding - 3.0m x 1.1m\nWith carpet, airing cupboard, attic hatch.\n\n"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "<ul><li>Constructed 2005</li><li>Floor area 110 sq m approx</li><li>Oil fired central heating</li><li>PVC double glazed windows</li><li>Wired for alarm</li><li>4 panel internal doors</li><li>Curtains, blinds, lightfittings</li><li>Off street parking</li><li>Side access</li><li>Garden shed.</ul>"
      },
